interface.longDescription:
OneSignal is the market leading customer engagement solution for push notifications, email, SMS, in-app messaging, and Live Activities. This plugin brings OneSignal onboarding into Codex: point it at your codebase and it installs the SDK, sets up your push credentials, and verifies that a real notification reaches your device.

Once installed, describe what you want in plain language or invoke the plugin directly with @OneSignal.

Try prompts like:
@OneSignal set up push notifications in this app.
@OneSignal upload my APNs .p8 key and Firebase service account to OneSignal.
@OneSignal why isn't my push notification arriving on Android?
@OneSignal send a test push to my device and confirm delivery.

Requirements: A free OneSignal account. A device, simulator, or browser that can receive push notifications.
